  /* No max-height/height override here on purpose — the iframe's height attribute
     (schools.astro) is the form's real content height. Capping it via CSS just
     forces a second, inner scrollbar; letting it render at full height means the
     page scrolls once, like everywhere else. If fields are added/removed on the
     Google Form, re-copy the new height from its embed code. */
